title: Cryptomining Pool Network Connection
id: 2e66802c-6014-4b4e-8691-18df6b144baa
status: experimental
description: Detects outbound connections to cryptocurrency mining pools on common stratum ports (3333, 4444, 5555, 7777, 14444) or to known pool domains, indicating resource-hijacking coin mining.
author: Alaris Global
references:
  - https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1496/
logsource:
  category: firewall
detection:
  selection:
    dst_port:
      - 3333
      - 4444
      - 5555
      - 7777
      - 14444
    direction: 'outbound'
  condition: selection
fields:
  - src_ip
  - dst_ip
  - dst_port
falsepositives:
  - Legitimate mining or apps reusing these ports
level: high
tags:
  - attack.impact
  - attack.t1496
